1
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:40,690
Come on, eat while it's hot.

2
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:41,960
Wait a minute.

3
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:43,720
Go call Zhang down.

4
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:48,880
Call him.

5
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:02,840
He's not answering. Let's just eat.

6
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:04,440
He might be too tired from yesterday.

7
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:06,720
He drove for hours.

8
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:08,320
Go upstairs and call him.

9
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:09,240
Hurry.

10
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:11,970
I'll try calling him again.

11
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:13,840
Thanks for your hard work.

12
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:14,640
It's nothing.

13
00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:20,720
What's all the noise?

14
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:23,060
So annoying early in the morning.

15
00:01:26,039 --> 00:01:26,970
I'll talk to him.

16
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:30,320
Come down and eat.

17
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:42,160
Qingqing, I didn't mean to snap at you.

18
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:44,090
You know I'm grumpy in the morning.

19
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:45,240
I'm used to it.

20
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:46,520
Eat up.

21
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:47,920
Eat before it gets cold.

22
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,520
Qingqing,

23
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,920
this is yam and egg yolk porridge.

24
00:01:51,240 --> 00:01:52,880
Haven't you been sleeping poorly lately?

25
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:53,759
This helps with sleep.

26
00:01:53,759 --> 00:01:54,520
Try it.

27
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:58,690
She doesn't like porridge.

28
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:02,860
What are you doing?

29
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:04,720
I'll drink it for you.

30
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:07,480
Mom will get you a bowl.

31
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:09,400
Auntie.

32
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:19,050
Thanks, Mom.

33
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:22,040
Qingqing,

34
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:24,760
take Zhang out for a walk this afternoon.

35
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:26,800
The scenery on the mountain is great.

36
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:27,840
I won't go.

37
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,100
My knees are acting up.

38
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,920
Well, we'll see if we have time.

39
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:33,880
Try this bun.

40
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:35,640
It's really good.

41
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:36,000
Okay.

42
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:37,560
Babe,

43
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,130
I want to drink this.

44
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:42,200
There are green onions on it.

45
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:05,240
Pick it out yourself if you don't want it.

46
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,440
Don't you have hands?

47
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,660
Gosh, it's become a habit.

48
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:15,840
Qingqing,

49
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:18,720
Mom brought you two bottles
of supplements this time.

50
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:20,560
This is Vitamin E.

51
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,130
It's good for your skin.

52
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:23,960
And these lutein capsules

53
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,600
are good for your eyes.

54
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:27,600
No wonder they say mothers
and daughters are connected.

55
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:29,840
You bought the exact same brand I did.

56
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:31,840
Good girl.

57
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,840
Take good care of yourself

58
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:33,920
so Mom won't worry,

59
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:34,720
okay?

60
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:38,370
I'll definitely take good care of myself.

61
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:39,640
Let's eat.

62
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,040
Emergency broadcast.

63
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:48,360
Moderate to heavy rain
is expected citywide

64
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:50,600
from this evening to tonight,

65
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:52,240
with possible torrential rain
in localized areas,

66
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:52,600
Auntie,

67
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:54,160
accompanied by severe lightning
and thunder.

68
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:55,040
Did you want to see me?

69
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:57,440
I let Zhang and Qingqing
go up the mountain this afternoon.

70
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,880
They still haven't come back.

71
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:00,040
I just checked the weather forecast.

72
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,200
There's a heavy rainstorm tonight.

73
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:02,720
They're not answering their phones either.

74
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:04,080
Could something have happened?

75
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,410
I'll try calling again.

76
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:09,520
It's all my fault.

77
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,800
If I had known there would be
a storm tonight,

78
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:12,200
I wouldn't have let them
go up the mountain.

79
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:14,080
Ma'am, please don't worry.

80
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,000
I'll go out and look for them.

81
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,529
I will definitely find her.

82
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,600
Zhang, you're back.

83
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:23,200
Where is Qingqing?

84
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,200
Isn't she back?

85
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:26,600
No, you two went out together.

86
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,160
How come you came back alone?

87
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,800
Ma'am, we were indeed together

88
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,160
when we took shelter
from the rain earlier.

89
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,400
But I went to the restroom,

90
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:33,680
and when I came back, she was gone.

91
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:36,040
I looked all over the mountain
but couldn't find her.

92
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,600
She didn't answer her phone either.

93
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:40,159
I figured her phone might be dead

94
00:04:40,159 --> 00:04:41,680
and she came back by herself.

95
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:43,000
Ma'am, it's all my fault.

96
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,530
I should have kept looking.

97
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:47,200
It's raining so heavily on the mountain.

98
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:48,000
If you had really looked for her,

99
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,640
your clothes and shoes
would be dirty by now.

100
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:50,760
And you're still lying.

101
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:51,840
What do you mean?

102
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:52,840
She's my girlfriend.

103
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,159
How could I not be worried?

104
00:04:54,159 --> 00:04:55,200
Stop pretending.

105
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:55,840
It's raining so hard,

106
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:56,840
and you left her alone on the mountain.

107
00:04:56,840 --> 00:04:57,600
Are you even a man?

108
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,640
Isn't she more familiar
with this area than I am?

109
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:00,600
Besides,

110
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:03,400
she's an adult.
What could possibly happen to her?

111
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:07,400
Cut the act.

112
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:11,080
Ma'am,

113
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:13,760
don't worry. It's fine.

114
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,240
Zhang Yi,

115
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:24,480
Zhang Yi,

116
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:28,260
Where did you go for the restroom?

117
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:31,280
How can a grown adult get lost?

118
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,880
Zhang Yi,

119
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,000
Zhang,

120
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:45,080
where did you two last part ways?

121
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:47,080
Were there any landmarks nearby?

122
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:50,200
Like a tree or a pavilion, for example?

123
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:53,050
Seriously, why aren't you worried at all?

124
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:54,970
What's the use of worrying?

125
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:56,600
Will it bring her back?

126
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:58,640
Does she mean anything to you at all?

127
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,320
What if something happens to her?

128
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:01,800
Zhang, stand up.

129
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,360
Let me ask you,

130
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,600
have you ever loved our Qingqing?

131
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:08,000
Ma'am, can we be a bit more realistic?

132
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,860
Yun Qingqing and I are not young anymore.

133
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:13,760
Isn't it childish to talk
about love and affection

134
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:14,800
now?

135
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,640
With Qingqing's conditions,

136
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:18,600
I'm already the best she can get.

137
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,600
Don't you value me so much

138
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:23,040
because of my family's background?

139
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:24,680
Qingqing is still immature,

140
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,820
but how can you be so naive too, ma'am?

141
00:06:38,159 --> 00:06:39,040
Qingqing!

142
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:42,480
Qingqing!

143
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,720
Yun Qingqing!

144
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:47,120
Qingqing!

145
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:49,560
Yun Qingqing!

146
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,440
Qingqing!

147
00:06:58,280 --> 00:06:59,440
Yun Qingqing!

148
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:01,720
Shen Feng!

149
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,520
Qingqing!

150
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:12,400
Qingqing!

151
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:18,080
Yun Qingqing!

152
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:22,280
What a fool.

153
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:25,400
It's not like I disappeared.

154
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:28,960
Qingqing! Qingqing!

155
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,560
Qingqing!

156
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,440
Shen Feng,

157
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:34,960
I'm here!

158
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:36,800
Qingqing!

159
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:40,200
Shen Feng!

160
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:42,440
Qingqing!

161
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,480
Are you okay?

162
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,660
Why are you crying?

163
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,220
Are you hurt anywhere?

164
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:31,440
No.

165
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,600
I just didn't expect that

166
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:36,840
in this world,

167
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,720
besides my parents,

168
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:42,600
someone would care about me so much.

169
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:53,960
I'm glad you're okay.

170
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:41,760
Qingqing,

171
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,400
Mom,

172
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:45,480
I'm sorry. It's my fault.

173
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:48,520
I shouldn't have let you
go up the mountain.

174
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,720
Mom, what's wrong?

175
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,800
I'm fine. I'm perfectly fine, see?

176
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:53,720
Thank goodness you're okay.

177
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,760
Don't worry.

178
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,000
I'm sorry.

179
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:04,800
I'm so mad.

180
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:07,160
If my mom hadn't kept nagging,

181
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:09,920
I never would've taken him
up the mountain.

182
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:11,480
He has no sense of responsibility at all.

183
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:13,840
Did you just find out
what kind of person he is today?

184
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,700
How did you put up with him before?

185
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:18,520
I remember

186
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,240
you said you didn't like him before.

187
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:24,040
So why did you end up with him?

188
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:27,160
I really didn't like him at first.

189
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:28,960
But people

190
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:31,260
always have moments of weakness.

191
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:33,160
When he was courting me,

192
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,480
he was so sweet and attentive.

193
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:38,080
Whatever I wanted to eat, play,

194
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,440
watch,

195
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:40,280
or go,

196
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:42,520
he could guess it immediately

197
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:44,250
like he was reading my mind.

198
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,280
And then

199
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:47,880
he would prepare
all kinds of surprises for me.

200
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:49,360
So at that time,

201
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:53,610
I thought he understood me better
than anyone else in the world.

202
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:59,400
But after I actually
got together with him,

203
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:01,400
all that patience and gentleness

204
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:02,960
slowly disappeared.

205
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:19,600
I remember

206
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:21,480
the first time I met his parents.

207
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:24,140
They were very dissatisfied with me.

208
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:26,760
They hinted that I was an outsider

209
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,600
and not good enough
for their local elite family.

210
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:31,800
His parents talked about you like that,

211
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:33,680
and he didn't even say a word for you?

212
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:34,940
Don't even mention it.

213
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:37,060
At first, he was clearly full,

214
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:38,760
but as soon as his parents
started criticizing me,

215
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:41,290
he lowered his head
and started eating again.

216
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:43,320
Not taking a stand at that moment

217
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,560
means he tacitly agreed with

218
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:46,360
his parents' evaluation of you.

219
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:47,340
He probably

220
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:49,880
always thought you were marrying up.

221
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,520
Me, marrying up?

222
00:11:51,800 --> 00:11:54,320
He was the one who shamelessly
chased after me back then.

223
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,600
Are you kidding me?

224
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:02,060
You're not going back to him, are you?

225
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:04,800
Don't worry. I'm a good horse.

226
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:17,800
The last piece is a reward
for a good horse.

227
00:12:20,680 --> 00:12:22,480
You've collected all the puzzle pieces.

228
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:24,800
As agreed, you can make a wish to me.

229
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:29,440
Then I have to think about it carefully.

230
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:46,840
Qingqing,

231
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,800
are you there?

232
00:13:36,280 --> 00:13:36,880
Zhang Yi!

233
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:41,400
You guys

234
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,600
are in here.

235
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:46,160
I knocked just now, but no one answered.

236
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:47,880
Do I have to open it just
because you knocked?

237
00:13:47,880 --> 00:13:49,000
If I had,

238
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:53,120
I wouldn't have seen
something so interesting.

239
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,360
What do you mean?

240
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,600
What are you doing?

241
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:05,160
Yesterday Qingqing even told me

242
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:07,600
you were her soulmate,

243
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:09,400
that you could read her mind.

244
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:11,580
I found it strange at the time.

245
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,720
No matter how well you know someone,

246
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:15,980
you can never know them this thoroughly.

247
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:19,520
Zhang Yi,

248
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:21,800
you are truly shameless.

249
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:29,720
So this is how you knew me so well,

250
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:31,400
by using these tricks.

251
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:36,960
Your camera was hidden
in that preserved flower.

252
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:39,520
Or in the eyes of the doll you gave me?

253
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:42,440
Forget it.

254
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:45,090
There's no need to know.

255
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:48,800
Qingqing,

256
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:50,480
I did all this because I love you so much.

257
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:51,200
Qingqing,

258
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:52,960
I wanted to know you.

259
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:55,040
I only did it to please you.

260
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:58,160
All those years, you always rejected me

261
00:14:58,680 --> 00:15:01,160
and never told me what you liked

262
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:02,400
or wanted.

263
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:04,610
So I really had no other choice.

264
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:08,400
Qingqing, I swear...

265
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:10,640
I'm the only one
who has seen these things.

266
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:11,720
No one else has.

267
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:15,200
And I never did anything like this

268
00:15:15,920 --> 00:15:17,360
while we were dating.

269
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,680
If it weren't for Shen Feng

270
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:21,560
pestering you,

271
00:15:21,560 --> 00:15:23,040
I wouldn't have done this.

272
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:25,980
This isn't love. It's a crime.

273
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,240
And you don't even like me,

274
00:15:31,640 --> 00:15:33,100
not the real Yun Qingqing.

275
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:36,960
You just want an obedient, virtuous wife

276
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:38,760
who can shoulder all
the family responsibilities

277
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:40,040
for you.

278
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:44,210
When you found out I lost my job,

279
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:46,800
your first reaction was
to break up with me.

280
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:50,520
Now you're back asking
to get back together,

281
00:15:50,520 --> 00:15:51,560
just because you couldn't find
a better replacement

282
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:53,040
during this time.

283
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:58,440
After all, in your heart,
I'm not good enough for you,

284
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:01,860
but at least I'm cost-effective, right?

285
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:08,650
Crying to me won't help.

286
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:14,620
Think about what you're going
to tell the police later.

287
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:17,240
Qingqing,

288
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:19,040
I was wrong.

289
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,360
I was really wrong.

290
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,960
Please don't call the police, okay?

291
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:24,280
If you call the police,

292
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:25,680
my life,

293
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:26,800
my studies,

294
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:29,200
everything will be ruined, Qingqing.

295
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:31,130
I'm begging you, Qingqing.

296
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:32,400
So,

297
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:36,200
what does that have to do with me?
